{# hKask v0.31.0 — prompt-enhance #}
{# Phase 3 (coding): Typed rewrite for coding prompts #}
{# goal: Apply audit findings as targeted mutations to produce a clearer coding prompt. #}
{#
  Group: G (Prompt Enhancement — typed rewrite)
  Coding prompts need: contract clarity, I/O spec, error cases, test-first
